{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Clues is an immersive hacker simulation game that allows players to act as agents of a mysterious organization and complete plot tasks through network penetration, social engineering and digital investigation. The game combines real network security technology, complex plot investigation and strategic social engineering to provide players with an authentic hacker experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Simulated hacker experience: gameplay includes network scanning, vulnerability exploitation, SQL injection, etc.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Deep social engineering: Obtain key information through email phishing, social media investigation and psychological manipulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Immersive plot: Investigate the target, collect evidence to reveal the truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Role-playing elements: Build relationships with the target, obtain internal information and access rights</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3402660?t=1759810075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402660/db022f03bf82c2ec96fa5fdb154e4ca763543f4a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759810075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402660/fe26aeb00c03fb0d3eac9ca1fbf28d313fe889a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759810075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402660/fe26aeb00c03fb0d3eac9ca1fbf28d313fe889a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759810075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro